    title: 'KuraiMusik',
    desc: 'Autonomous AI radio broadcasting 24/7 with zero human intervention. Dynamic buffer system with ACE-Step 1.5 engine. Circuit breaker pattern for resilience. Professional DSP with Liquidsoap: AGC, crossfades, real-time ID3 metadata.',
